return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Boshqa hech qanday yoʻl bilan yetib borolmaydigan xostlarimiz uchun ushbu WordPress saytini — fayllar va maʼlumotlar bazasini — Zinn Digital® tortib olishi mumkin boʻlgan bitta arxivga joylaydi. Uni TARK ETAYOTGAN saytingizga oʻrnating, bitta tugmani bosing va havolani Zinn® migratsiyangizga joylashtiring.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Ushbu saytni Zinn®-ga koʻchiring','Move to Zinn®'=>'Zinn® ga koʻchirish','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Buni bajarish uchun sizda ruxsat yo‘q.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Bu ushbu saytdagi barcha narsalarni — uning fayllari va maʼlumotlar bazasini — bitta arxivga jamlaydi va sizga unga xususiy havola beradi. Ushbu havolani Zinn® tizimidagi koʻchirishingizga joylashtiring va biz saytni oʻtkazib beramiz. Siz havolani ulashishni tanlamaguningizcha, bu yerdan hech narsa hech qayerga yuborilmaydi.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Sizga bu kerak boʻlmasligi mumkin. Agar eski xostingiz sizga FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk yoki DirectAdmin taqdim etsa, Zinn® ushbu maʼlumotlar orqali saytni toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri koʻchirib olishi mumkin va siz ushbu plaginni butunlay oʻtkazib yuborishingiz mumkin — bu tezroq va keyinchalik hech narsa qolib ketmaydi. Ushbu variantlarning hech biri sizda mavjud boʻlmaganda bundan foydalaning.','Room on this server'=>'Ushbu serverdagi boʻsh joy','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Ushbu server bizga qancha disk maydoni bo‘sh ekanligini aytmaydi, shuning uchun biz buni siz uchun tekshira olmaymiz. To‘plam uchun taxminan %s kerak. Agar buncha joy borligiga ishonchingiz komil bo‘lmasa, uni yaratishdan oldin xosting provayderingizdan so‘rang — jarayon o‘rtasida joyi tugab qolgan server saytni ishdan chiqaradi.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Paket uchun taxminan %1$s zarur va ushbu serverda %2$s boʻsh joy mavjud.','Build the package'=>'Paketni yigʻish','Building…'=>'Yaratilmoqda…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Hozir paketlanmoqda: %1$s. Hozirgacha %2$s ta fayl, %3$s yozildi.','your files'=>'Fayllaringiz','your database'=>'Maʼlumotlar bazangiz','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Cancel and delete'=>'Bekor qilish va o‘chirish','Your package is ready'=>'Paketingiz tayyor','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Ushbu havoladan nusxa oling va uni Zinn® platformasidagi migratsiyangizga joylashtiring:','Size: %s.'=>'Hajmi: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Ushbu havolaga parol kabi munosabatda boʻling. Unga ega boʻlgan har qanday shaxs butun saytingizni, jumladan maʼlumotlar bazangizni yuklab olishi mumkin. Biz toʻplamni yaratilganidan 24 soat oʻtgach avtomatik ravishda oʻchirib tashlaymiz — koʻchirish jarayoni tugashi bilanoq uni oʻzingiz oʻchirib tashlang.','Delete the package now'=>'Paketni hozir oʻchiring','Build it again'=>'Uni qayta quring','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Ushbu serverda PHP ning ZipArchive kengaytmasi mavjud emas, shuning uchun biz bu yerda paket yarata olmaymiz. Xosting provayderingizdan uni yoqishni so‘rang yoki buning o‘rniga FTP yoinki SSH maʼlumotlaringiz bilan Zinn® dagi ko‘chirish shaklidan foydalaning.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Yuklamalar katalogingiz ichida jild yaratib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun paketni yozish uchun joy yoʻq. wp-content/uploads yozish uchun ruxsatga egaligini tekshiring.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Hech qanday paket yaratilmayapti. Avval bittasini boshlang.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Paket faylini yozish uchun ochib boʻlmadi.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Maʼlumotlar bazasi eksportini yozib boʻlmadi.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qoʻllanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasini oʻqing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul koʻchirish va birdan ortiq saytni boshqaradigan kishilar uchun yaratilgan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Har ikki tomon rozi boʻlguniga qadar mablagʻ xavfsiz saqlangan holda faoliyat koʻrsatayotgan saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishlarini sotib oling hamda soting.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bu ish bilan tirikchilik qiladigan kishilarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilans bozorimiz: yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini koʻrib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtiring va ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® reliz qaydlarini ko‘ring.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® yangilash xizmati ushbu yangilanish uchun yuklab olish havolasini taqdim etmadi. Ushbu sayt Zinn® platformasiga ulana olishini tekshiring, soʻngra qayta urinib koʻring.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Yangilanishni Zinn® yangilash xizmatidan (%s) yuklab boʻlmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish butunlik tekshiruvidan o‘tmadi va o‘rnatilmadi.']];